---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Section from '../components/ui/Section.astro';
import SectionHeader from '../components/ui/SectionHeader.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy — StarkRank"
  description="How StarkRank collects, uses, and protects your personal data. This policy covers our website analytics, contact forms, and cookie usage."
>
  <Section bg="cream">
    <SectionHeader label="Legal" title="Privacy Policy" />
    <h1 class="sr-only">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-3xl font-body text-dark [&>h2]:font-headline [&>h2]:font-black [&>h2]:text-navy [&>h2]:mt-10 [&>h2]:mb-3 [&>h3]:font-headline [&>h3]:font-bold [&>h3]:text-navy [&>h3]:mt-6 [&>h3]:mb-2 [&>p]:text-gray [&>p]:leading-relaxed [&>ul]:text-gray [&>ul>li]:leading-relaxed">
      <p><strong>Effective date:</strong> March 2026<br /><strong>Last updated:</strong> March 2026</p>

      <p>StarkRank ("we", "us", "our") operates the website starkrank.com. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, and protect your personal data when you visit our website.</p>

      <h2>Who is responsible?</h2>
      <p>StarkRank LLC<br />540 NW 4th Ave, Fort Lauderdale, FL 33311<br />United States<br />Email: contact@starkrank.com</p>
      <p>For users in Switzerland, the responsible entity is <strong>Datanalytico Feye</strong> (UID: CHE-220.283.724), Langegasse 117, 4104 Oberwil, Switzerland. Email: info@datanalytico.com. Datanalytico Feye operates the Swiss (/ch-de/) version of starkrank.com and handles services, contracts, and billing for Swiss clients. See the <a href="/ch-de/impressum/" class="text-blue hover:text-blue-light">Impressum (Schweiz)</a> for full details.</p>

      <h2>What data do we collect?</h2>

      <h3>Website analytics (Google Analytics 4)</h3>
      <p>We use Google Analytics 4 (Measurement ID: G-FCS0HH5VC0) to understand how visitors use our website. This service is provided by Google LLC.</p>
      <p><strong>Before you consent:</strong> No cookies are set and no personally identifiable data is collected. Google Analytics operates in cookieless mode, collecting only anonymised, aggregated pageview data.</p>
      <p><strong>After you consent:</strong> Google Analytics may set cookies to distinguish unique visitors and sessions. Data collected includes pages visited, time on site, approximate location (country/city level), device type, and referral source.</p>
      <p>We have implemented Google Consent Mode v2, which ensures that tracking behaviour adapts to your consent choice. You can change your consent at any time by clearing your browser's local storage for this site.</p>

      <h3>Contact forms</h3>
      <p>When you submit a contact form, we collect the information you provide (name, email address, message). This data is used solely to respond to your enquiry and is not shared with third parties.</p>

      <h3>Server logs</h3>
      <p>Our hosting provider automatically collects standard server log data including IP addresses, browser type, and pages requested. This data is used for security monitoring and is not linked to individual users.</p>

      <h2>Cookies</h2>
      <p>Our website uses the following categories of cookies:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Essential:</strong> Local storage entry for your cookie consent preference. No expiry — persists until you clear browser data.</li>
        <li><strong>Analytics (requires consent):</strong> Google Analytics cookies (_ga, _ga_*) used to distinguish visitors and sessions. Expire after 2 years.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>We do not use advertising cookies, social media tracking pixels, or any third-party marketing cookies.</p>

      <h2>Legal basis for processing</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Consent</strong> (Art. 6(1)(a) GDPR / Art. 6(1)(a) nDSG): Analytics cookies are only activated after you explicitly consent via our cookie banner.</li>
        <li><strong>Legitimate interest</strong> (Art. 6(1)(f) GDPR): Server logs and essential site functionality.</li>
        <li><strong>Contract performance</strong> (Art. 6(1)(b) GDPR): Processing contact form data to respond to your enquiry.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Data transfers</h2>
      <p>Google Analytics data may be transferred to servers in the United States. Google LLC participates in the EU-US Data Privacy Framework. We rely on Standard Contractual Clauses (SCCs) and Google's data processing terms for adequate data protection.</p>

      <h2>Your rights</h2>
      <p>Depending on your location, you have the right to:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Access the personal data we hold about you</li>
        <li>Request correction or deletion of your data</li>
        <li>Withdraw consent at any time (for analytics: clear local storage or decline cookies)</li>
        <li>Object to processing based on legitimate interest</li>
        <li>Lodge a complaint with your local data protection authority</li>
      </ul>
      <p>For EU/EEA residents, the relevant supervisory authority depends on your country of residence. For Swiss residents, the Federal Data Protection and Information Commissioner (FDPIC) is the responsible authority.</p>

      <h2>Data retention</h2>
      <p>Google Analytics data is retained for 14 months, after which it is automatically deleted. Contact form data is retained for the duration of the business relationship, then deleted within 12 months. Server logs are retained for a maximum of 90 days.</p>

      <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
      <p>We may update this policy to reflect changes in our practices or legal requirements. The "Last updated" date at the top indicates the most recent revision.</p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>For data protection enquiries:<br />
      Email: contact@starkrank.com<br />
      StarkRank LLC, 540 NW 4th Ave, Fort Lauderdale, FL 33311, United States</p>
      <p>Swiss clients: info@datanalytico.com — Datanalytico Feye, Langegasse 117, 4104 Oberwil, Switzerland.</p>
    </div>
  </Section>
</BaseLayout>
